          "mechanism": "Sex classification determines biological eligibility for menopausal hormone therapy and sex-specific cholesterol metabolism patterns.",
          "justification": "Essential demographic variable. Only individuals classified female at birth typically receive menopausal estrogen hormones. Sex affects cholesterol levels through both endogenous and exogenous estrogen effects.",
