          },
          "mechanism": "Race/ethnicity is associated with differential healthcare access and hormone prescription patterns; also associated with genetic and socioeconomic factors affecting cholesterol levels and screening practices.",
          "justification": "Ethnicity predicts both exposure (access to reproductive endocrinology care, cultural attitudes toward menopausal hormone use) and outcome (cholesterol screening frequency, cardiovascular risk profiles, health-seeking behavior).",
          "role": "confounder",
          "proxy_for": null,
          "contestable": false
        },
