          },
          "mechanism": "Race is associated with both healthcare-seeking patterns/provider prescribing patterns and metabolic health outcomes including cholesterol.",
          "justification": "Race predicts access to specialized reproductive care, patterns of hormone therapy use, and cholesterol-related health outcomes through multiple pathways (genetic variation in lipid metabolism, socioeconomic factors, differential screening).",
          "role": "confounder",
          "proxy_for": null,
          "contestable": false
        },
        {
