          },
          "mechanism": "Height component of BMI calculation.",
          "justification": "BMI (weight ÷ height²) confounds the relationship between hormone use and cholesterol; will be derived by combining height (feet and inches components) with weight.",
          "role": "confounder",
          "proxy_for": null,
          "contestable": false
        },
        {
          "variable": {
