          },
          "mechanism": "Type 2 diabetes is a descendant of exposure and mediator of the exposure-outcome relationship.",
          "justification": "Estrogen use may affect glucose tolerance and diabetes risk; diabetes diagnosis is a marker of healthcare engagement and surveillance, which increases the likelihood of cholesterol screening and diagnosis being documented. Excluding this prevents blocking the pathway.",
          "role": "mediator",
          "proxy_for": null,
          "contestable": false
        },
        {
